   "widgets_values": [
    "⚗ ALCHEMICA — SIMPLE\n\nThe model goes through the LoRA stack and then into the sampler.\nSlot on '(nessuna)' or strength 0 = off. The text encoder goes through\nit too, so LoRAs also act on the text (forza_clip scales them all).\n\nResolution: 4 MP is the sweet spot between detail and time (~45-60 s).\n5 MP only for close-ups, with modo 'veloce' (fast).\n\nmodo: veloce (fast) / equilibrato (balanced) / massimo dettaglio (max detail)\nridisegno -1 = from the profile · dettaglio 0.12 validated · varieta 0.6"
   ],
   "title": "⚗ AlchemicaMente · notes"
  }
